cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Danqing saves you time on scientific figures, please cite the software using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Danqing (丹青): Lossless Scientific Figure & Manuscript Recoloring Studio"
abstract: >-
  Open-source lossless vector PDF/SVG scientific figure and manuscript recoloring studio,
  MCP server, and AI agent plugin. Eliminates hours of tedious trial-and-error hex tweaking
  with 3,434 primary-source-verified accessible, CNS/journal, museum, Sanzo Wada, and CC0 Eastern mineral palettes
  while keeping every coordinate, glyph, and raw experimental image (Western blots, H&E) intact.
authors:
  - family-names: "Han"
    given-names: "Xinyin"
    alias: "owehann"
version: "0.6.3"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/owehann/danqing"
url: "https://danqing.onrender.com"
keywords:
  - scientific-visualization
  - color-palettes
  - accessibility
  - colorblind-safe
  - pdf
  - svg
  - mcp-server
  - agent-skill
